> This means you have some characters in your file which cannot be represented in 
> your current encoding. Often times those are typographic quotes or long 
> dashes. Either find those characters and replace them, or switch to UTF-8 
> encoding (Edit->Tools Move->Encoding).
> 
> Note that the warning message comes from the katepart that we use for the 
> editor in RKWard. And yes, this warning could really be more helpful (see also 
